import json
D=[
("D023","Y","As part of the investigation, warranty data was analyzed and five warranty claims potentially related to this issue were identified, all on MY2021 Prevost X3-45 Commuter.","An analysis (warranty data analyzed) conducted to find the scope of the issue is INVESTIGATION_START per rules ('analysis or testing is ... conducted to find the cause or scope')."),
("D024","X","2023-02-27 Prevost requested the seat supplier to perform a survey on potentially affected vehicles to support the ongoing investigation.","Requesting a field survey of potentially affected vehicles starts an investigative activity to find scope; INVESTIGATION_START fits better than OTHER."),
("D025","Y","According to the supplier, approximately 63% of the inspected vehicles had at least one loose or disengaged seat recline mechanism bolt.","The supplier reports a finding about the problem to the filer, which is SUPPLIER_NOTICE ('the supplier confirmed ...', 'a finding')."),
("D026","Y","The field report indicated that the seat recline function was inoperative and that the seatback could move freely on certain seats.","This sentence only describes the content of the field report already counted in the preceding sentence; it reports no new action, so it is not an event."),
("D027","Y","The warranty claims were received on 2022-03-30, 2022-07-21, 2022-12-21, 2022-12-21, and on 2023-02-14.","The sentence has its own dates, so it yields events with those dates (FILER_AWARENESS), not an inherited 2023-01-27 OTHER event."),
("D028","X","The warranty claims were received on 2022-03-30, 2022-07-21, 2022-12-21, 2022-12-21, and on 2023-02-14.","Distinct own date in the sentence; warranty claims reaching the filer are FILER_AWARENESS."),
("D029","X","The warranty claims were received on 2022-03-30, 2022-07-21, 2022-12-21, 2022-12-21, and on 2023-02-14.","Distinct own date in the sentence; warranty claim receipt is FILER_AWARENESS."),
("D030","X","The warranty claims were received on 2022-03-30, 2022-07-21, 2022-12-21, 2022-12-21, and on 2023-02-14.","Distinct own date (2022-12-21, listed twice, one event); warranty claim receipt is FILER_AWARENESS."),
("D031","Y","The warranty claims were received on 2022-03-30, 2022-07-21, 2022-12-21, 2022-12-21, and on 2023-02-14.","2023-02-14 is a distinct own date in the sentence; warranty claim receipt is FILER_AWARENESS, so the event exists."),
("D032","X","2023-08-17: Added Prevost's identification code for this recall.","Amending the Part 573 report (adding the recall ID code) is NHTSA_FILING ('submits or amends a Part 573 report')."),
("D033","CONTESTED","2023-06-05: 2 additional power steering hose failures are reported from the same customer. A field report is created.","The versions are two different sentences of the same entry, both valid events: the dated customer report (FILER_AWARENESS) and the inherited 'A field report is created' (OTHER). The pairing, not the type, differs; rules do not settle which one this item refers to."),
("D034","Y","January 18 - 22, 2023 Cummins had indication that there had been fuel line failures out in the field these where brought to their attention during the Tampa RV Super show.","This sentence is the supplier (Cummins) becoming aware, not the filer, so X's FILER_AWARENESS is wrong; it is OTHER. Y's inherited event (Pleasure-Way removed generators, inside the same dated entry) is a valid OTHER event with that date."),
("D035","X","Cummins conducted a review and testing of the product and concluded on March 28, 2023 that a defect existed.","A conclusion that a defect exists is DECISION ('the decision that a safety defect or noncompliance exists'); the rule does not limit DECISION to the filer."),
("D036","X","April 21, 2023 Pleasure-Way provided a list to Cummins  of all owners and dealers with the generators under recall.","Providing owner/dealer lists for the recall is remedy logistics (owner/dealer notification), which the rules exclude from events."),
]
out=[{"item_id":a,"decision":b,"quote":c,"reason":d} for a,b,c,d in D]
json.dump(out,open("decisions.json","w"),indent=1,ensure_ascii=False)
